  - m_Id: 6819880636637
    m_Localized: Hold Space to skip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636638
    m_Localized: And thank you, for defeating the King while bearing every curse.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636639
    m_Localized: Move with <color=#FFD54A>WASD</color>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636640
    m_Localized: <color=#FFD54A>Left Click</color> to throw a bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636641
    m_Localized: <color=#FFD54A>Space</color> to dash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636642
    m_Localized: You are <color=#FFD54A>invincible</color> while dashing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636643
    m_Localized: <color=#FFD54A>Right Click</color> to use a powerful skill
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636644
    m_Localized: 'When a gauge slot is full, you can use your skill.

      Defeat
      enemies to fill the gauge!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636645
    m_Localized: 'Open the feedback survey page?

      (It opens in a new browser
      tab.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636646
    m_Localized: Basic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636647
    m_Localized: Balanced. Steadily throws standard-range bombs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636648
    m_Localized: Double Barrel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636649
    m_Localized: Two shots per click. The second flies to wherever your cursor is
      at that moment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636650
    m_Localized: Rapid Fire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636651
    m_Localized: 'Smaller blasts, but faster reloads

      and quicker explosions.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636652
    m_Localized: Big Blast
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636653
    m_Localized: 'Wider blasts, but slower reloads

      and slower explosions.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636654
    m_Localized: Triple Bomb
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6819880636655
    m_Localized: 'Hold up to 3 bombs,

      but reload a little slower.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259200
    m_Localized: How DARE you scratch Our royal body..!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259201
    m_Localized: You insolent little goblin!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259202
    m_Localized: (What a peaceful goblin village!)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259203
    m_Localized: Haah~~ Maybe I'll read a book for once??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259204
    m_Localized: Wh-whoa?! Wh..what is this!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259205
    m_Localized: I'm getting sucked iiiinnnn~!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259206
    m_Localized: "I-I'm back\u2026! I'm really back!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259207
    m_Localized: This crazy book is sealed..... FOREVER..!!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259208
    m_Localized: 'Wh..what... is that letter...?

      I''m sure I sealed the book....??'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259209
    m_Localized: Wha??? A-an INVOICEEE?!?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 26375806259210
    m_Localized: <color=#FFD54A>Black Hole</color> pulls enemies together and blows
      them up all at once!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
